ore":"40-22","values":[1,25,25,25,0,0,0,0,0,0]}]}},"summaryLabel":"2026 season stats","news":[{"headline":"Indiana starting guard Brunner out for season with ACL injury","description":"Indiana starting guard Joe Brunner will miss the rest of the season after sustaining an ACL injury in Thursday's practice, coach Curt Cignetti said on Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T18:20:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503016/indiana-starting-guard-brunner-season-acl-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NC State hires Jatavis Sanders as GM under Philip Rivers","description":"NC State has hired Jatavis Sanders as its general manager under new coach Philip Rivers, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T16:33:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502157/nc-state-hires-jatavis-sanders-gm-philip-rivers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"ACC suspends Louisville LB Clark, UNC DB Smith over postgame brawl","description":"The ACC has suspended Louisville LB Stanquan Clark and North Carolina DB Greg Smith III, while also issuing fines and public reprimands to both schools in the wake of Saturday's postgame brawl.","published":"2026-11-16T16:19:01.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502075/louisville-lb-clark-unc-db-smith-suspended-postgame-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan top WR JJ Buchanan (shoulder) likely out for season","description":"Michigan's leading receiver JJ Buchanan will likely miss the rest of the season after he sustained a shoulder injury in Saturday's loss at No. 16 Oregon.","published":"2026-11-16T16:30:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502065/michigan-top-wr-jj-buchanan-shoulder-likely-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-16T16:00:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UTEP fires head coach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-16T14:25:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T13:48:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026-27 Week 11 College Football Playoff, bowl projections","description":"Our bowl gurus take a look at how the postseason picture shifted after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:28:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473016/2026-week-11-college-football-playoff-bowl-projections","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura and Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football takeaways: Lasting impressions from Week 11","description":"Our college football experts break down the most important things they saw in Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:21:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/mondaytakeaways111626/2026-college-football-takeaways-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138451/luke-reynolds","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":53,"round":2,"team":"CLE","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Luke Reynolds (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:22Z","intro":"Luke Reynolds is an American college football tight end for the Virginia Tech Hokies. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Reynolds grew up in Westford, Massachusetts and originally attended Lawrence Academy in Groton, Massachusetts. He transferred to Cheshire Academy in Cheshire, Connecticut after his sophomore year. As a senior, he caught 48 passes for 754 yards and nine touchdowns. After the season Reynolds played in the 2024 All-American Bowl.\nReynolds was initially rated a three-star recruit and committed to play college football at Penn State. He was later reranked as a five-star recruit and the best tight end prospect in the 2024 class by 247Sports."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Reynolds joined the Penn State Nittany Lions as an early enrollee in January 2024. He entered his freshman season as a backup at tight end to Tyler Warren. Reynolds finished his first season with the team with nine receptions for 111 yards and one touchdown. He played in all 13 of the Nittany Lions' games as a sophomore and caught 26 passes for 257 yards. After the end of the season, Reynolds entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nReynolds transferred to Virginia Tech, reuniting him with former Penn State head coach James Franklin."}]}}